must be evaluated carefully for two-decimal analyser readings; a new farmer-level 10-day aggregation 
function is needed for the > 500 L bonus. 
• Two-Decimal Step Calculation Effect: With 4.25% fat, (4.25 - 3.5) / 0.1 = 7.5 steps. Under Python's round
half-to-even, round(7.5) gives 8 steps, whereas round(6.5) gives 6 steps! Using exact Decimal arithmetic 
with ROUND_HALF_UP (or proportional sub-step pricing, depending on union bylaw—here standardizing 
step rounding with Decimal ROUND_HALF_UP) prevents inconsistent half-step rounding. 
